[h1]OpenZone Games[/h1]
Table games for DayZ in the OpenZone series. Lay a deck, a board or a can of dice out on a table, a counter or the floor (a hologram shows the seats the spot has): the mod works out where the others can sit or stand around it, and the game is played in a window while the characters sit at it; others may watch. Made for the whole Ukrainian DayZ community.

[b]What you get[/b]
[list]
[*]Cards: durak, ochko, Texas hold'em, preferans and bridge. Two decks, the classic one and the stalkers'; every card is an item, and a game is dealt from the cards the deck really holds.
[*]Boards: chess, draughts, giveaway, corners, long and short nardy on a "3 in 1" board. Two sets, the classic one and the stalkers', stalkers against mutants; the pieces are items too.
[*]Dice: thousand, dice poker, pig, high roll and perudo, on the host's dice or each on a can of his own. The can stands at the seat that throws: everyone sees it shaken and tipped and the dice fly out.
[*]Stakes in chips (ochko, hold'em, dice poker, high roll): the mod touches no money. The host says how many chips each brings in; a paper says at the end who brought in what and who had what.
[*]Cheating: a card sharp's kit marks cards and loads dice. Sleights with cards and on a board, a die swapped into the can: each may show, and the others may notice it. The server's log keeps every sleight.
[*]Every sound is the mod's own. Push-to-talk works while the window is open. A seat waits for a player who walks off; everything survives a restart. English and Ukrainian.
[/list]

[b]Needs[/b] Community Framework and OpenZone Core.

[b]For administrators[/b] One file, [i]profile/OpenZone/OZ_Games_Settings.json[/i]: the games, the seats, the poses and every cheating setting ([i]Cheating[/i] 0 switches cheating off), edited in the core's admin window. [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3845883015]OpenZone Games for VPP Admin Tools[/url] puts the games, the seats, the poses and the cards' cheating into VPP Admin Tools. Nothing is in a loot table: docs/examples in the repository has the lines for types.xml.

[b]Licence, repacking, selling[/b]
You may repack this mod into your server's own pack, keeping the attribution and the same licence. You may not sell it, sublicense it or include it in any paid bundle. Running it on a server that accepts donations, sells cosmetics or priority queue slots is fine. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 with the additional permission in NOTICE.

[b]S.T.A.L.K.E.R.[/b] The stalkers' deck and table and the stalker chess and draughts use pictures and models from the S.T.A.L.K.E.R. games. They are created and fully owned by GSC Game World and are not covered by this mod's licence. OpenZone Games is a fan-made mod, not official, with no affiliation with GSC Game World. The original games: https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/stalker
The classic chess pieces are reduced from Poly Haven's Chess Set (CC0).

Source: github.com/OpenZone-DayZ/openzone-games.

